        <!-- Side Blogs -->
        <div class="side-blogs">
            <div class="side-blog">
                <a href="blog-detail.html">
                    <img src="https://baobariavungtau.com.vn/dataimages/201808/original/images1454316_ca_koi_4.jpg" alt="Koi swimming in lake">
                    <div class="side-blog-content">
                        <h4>The lake is famous for its picturesque appearance</h4>
                        <p>Many people didn't believe the photo of Lake Namonaki was real until they saw...</p>
