            <div class="side-blog">
                <a href="blog-detail.html">
                    <img src="https://yokokoi.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/sakura-boost-koi-growth-muscle-protein-38-tang-truong-co-bap-1-5-6-kg_02.jpg" alt="Koi fish feeding process">
                    <div class="side-blog-content">
                        <h4>Koi fish feeding process at the farm</h4>
                        <p>Feeding Koi fish at the farm is an essential part of their care, ensuring they grow healthy and vibrant...</p>
                        <div class="meta">Jan 18, 2024</div>
                    </div>
                </a>
            </div>

            <div class="side-blog">
                <a href="blog-detail.html">
                    <img src="https://i.pinimg.com/736x/cf/46/c7/cf46c72e26a66cef29413b75dc6cd052.jpg" alt="Standard Koi fish price in Japan">
                    <div class="side-blog-content">
                        <h4>Standard Koi fish price in Japan</h4>
                        <p>Koi fish, known for their vibrant colors and elegant beauty, are prized by hobbyists and collectors around the world...</p>
                        <div class="meta">May 12, 2024</div>
                    </div>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Week Trending Section -->
    <section class="trending">
        <h2>Week Trending</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="blog-detail.html">"The Power of Perseverance: How Koi Fish Symbolize Strength"</a><span>Dec 12, 2024</span></li>
            <li><a href="blog-detail.html">"Koi Fish Varieties Explained: Understanding the Colors and Patterns"</a><span>Dec 13, 2024</span></li>
            <li><a href="blog-detail.html">"Building the Perfect Koi Pond: Essential Tips"</a><span>Dec 14, 2024</span></li>
            <li><a href="blog-detail.html">"The History of Koi Fish Breeding: From Ancient Ponds"</a><span>Dec 13, 2024</span></li>
            <li><a href="blog-detail.html">"Koi Fish In Pop Culture: How These Iconic Fish Have Inspired"</a><span>Dec 13, 2024</span></li>
        </ul>
    </section>
</body>
</html>
